**
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!vela/
!vela/**
!web/
!web/**
# The `computer` target installs the browser worker itself and needs only
# these files; a developer's local node_modules or provenance must not
# leak into the build context. Everything else — .git, plans/, local data,
# build output — stays excluded by the `**` above and the entries below.
!scripts/
!scripts/setup-browser-worker.py
!scripts/browser-worker/
!scripts/browser-worker/package.json
!scripts/browser-worker/package-lock.json
!scripts/browser-worker/src/
!scripts/browser-worker/src/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
scripts/browser-worker/node_modules/
scripts/browser-worker/provenance.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
